    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Continue each row",
        "body": "In every row circles and squares take turns, and each row starts with the other shape than the row above.\n\n- Row 1: nothing is covered.\n- Row 2 (square, circle, square, …): the 3rd place is covered, a square.\n- Row 3 (circle, square, circle, …): the 3rd place is covered, a circle.\n- Row 4 (square, circle, square, circle, …): the 3rd and 4th places are covered, a square and a circle.\n\nAltogether 2 circles and 2 squares.\n\n**Answer: (E) 2 circles and 2 squares**"
