    "prompt": "Diana shoots three arrows at a target. On her first try, she gets 6 points and the arrows land like this. On her second try, she gets 8 points and the arrows land like this. On her third try, the arrows land like this. How many points will she get the third time?",
    "image": "qimages/kangaroo/ca-2018-g0102/q14.webp",
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "8"
      },
      {
