        "text": "12"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "14"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "16"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Value of each ring",
        "body": "First try: all 3 arrows are in the outer ring and give 6 points, so the outer ring is worth $6 \\div 3 = 2$ points.\n\nSecond try: 2 arrows in the outer ring ($2 + 2 = 4$) and 1 in the middle, for 8 points. So the middle is worth $8 - 4 = 4$ points.\n\nThird try: all 3 arrows are in the middle: $3 \\times 4 = 12$ points.\n\n**Answer: (C) 12**"
      }
    ],
